Package: jcode
Version: 0.86.0
Architecture: all
Pre-Depends: glibc-repo
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: glibc, curl, tar, patchelf, findutils
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/1jehuang/jcode
Description: Terminal coding agent harness
 jcode is a multi‑session coding agent harness with a fast local TUI,
 persistent memory, and MCP support. This package downloads the
 official Linux binary and patches it to run inside Termux's glibc
 environment.
